        },
        "description": "__Species:__ Human\n__Affiliation:__ Humanity \n\nJack the Ripper, or Jack, is an infamous serial killer hailing from late 19th century Britain.\n\nNormally, Jack has the disposition of a typical British Gentlemen, accentuated by his sophisticated diction and actions. However, Jack is a true sadist and monster at heart, being considered by most to be a person shrouded in malice and evil, murdering people as he considers the fear they feel before death to be absolutely beautiful. ~!Jack the Ripper is Humanity's representative in the fourth round of Ragnarok.!~",
